{"type":"assistant_message","payload":{"text":"### Outcome\nImplemented the Agents feature with Orca parity across the frontend:\n\n1. **Agent settings persistence (`ui/src/lib/agentsSettings.ts`)**:\n   - Defined `AGENT_CANDIDATES` constant: `[\"claude\", \"codex\", \"gemini\", \"opencode\", \"aider\", \"cursor-agent\", \"droid\", \"crush\"]`.\n   - Implemented `loadAgentSettings()` and `saveAgentSettings()` backed by localStorage key `ferryx.agents.v1` (`{ version: 1, defaultAgentId, overrides }`).\n   - Implemented pure helpers `mergeDetections(settings, detections)` and `getLaunchableAgents(resolved)` with default fallback logic.\n   - Added unit test suite in `ui/src/lib/agentsSettings.test.ts` (7/7 passing).\n\n2. **Settings panel (`ui/src/components/SettingsDialog.tsx`)**:\n   - Added dedicated `Agents` tab in the navigation with `Bot` icon.\n   - Added \"Default Agent\" row with segmented buttons (`Auto`, `None`, and available detected agents with active checkmarks).\n   - Added \"Installed\" header displaying detected count badge and a `Refresh` button re-running CLI agent detection via `cmd_agents_detect`.\n   - Added per-agent rows displaying name, mono command sub-label, `Detected`/`Not detected` status badges, `Enabled`/`Disabled` toggles, and expandable mono `Command` / `Arguments` override inputs.\n\n3. **New-tab menu agents group (`ui/src/components/NewTabPopover.tsx`, `TabBar.tsx`, `TerminalSplitView.tsx`)**:\n   - Added `agents` and `onLaunchAgent` props to `NewTabPopover`.\n   - Rendered divider + `AGENTS` header + agent button rows with `Sparkles` icon and capitalized names.\n   - Plumbed `agents` and `onLaunchAgent` through `TabBar` and `TerminalSplitView`.\n\n4. **App integration (`ui/src/App.tsx`)**:\n   - Loads agent settings and runs `detectAgents()` on mount under Tauri runtime.\n   - Wired `handleLaunchAgent`: creates a terminal session tab for the active worktree and executes `${command} ${args}\\r` via `writeTerminal`.\n   - Passes computed launchable agents into `TerminalSplitView`.\n\n---\n\n### Verification\n- **Unit Tests (`bun run --cwd ui test`)**:\n  - `src/lib/agentsSettings.test.ts`: **7 passed**\n  - `src/components/SettingsDialog.test.tsx`: **14 passed**\n  - `src/components/NewTabPopover.test.tsx`: **9 passed**\n  - `src/components/TabBar.test.tsx`: **13 passed**\n  - `src/App.test.tsx`: **18 passed**\n  - `src/lib/tauri.test.ts`: **12 passed**\n  - `src/lib/storageKeys.test.ts`: **4 passed**\n  - Total related test suite: **77 passed / 77 tests (100% pass)**\n  *(Note: 5 pre-existing failures in `terminalHostManager.test.ts` remain isolated and unchanged.)*\n\n- **Production Build (`bun run --cwd ui build`)**:\n  - `tsc && vite build`: **Completed successfully in 6.29s with 0 TypeScript or bundling errors.**\n\n- **Cargo scope**: No changes outside `ui/`."}}
