{"type":"assistant_message","payload":{"text":"### Intent and Resolution\n\n#### 1. RED Test on TabBar DOM Structure\n- **Added regression test**: `renders new tab trigger and popover outside the horizontal overflow tablist container to avoid vertical clipping` in `ui/src/components/TabBar.test.tsx`.\n- **Exact RED Failure Output**:\n  ```\n  FAIL  src/components/TabBar.test.tsx > TabBar > renders new tab trigger and popover outside the horizontal overflow tablist container to avoid vertical clipping\n  AssertionError: expected true to be false // Object.is equality\n  - Expected: false\n  + Received: true\n  ❯ src/components/TabBar.test.tsx:331:44\n     expect(tablist.contains(newTabButton)).toBe(false);\n  ```\n\n#### 2. GREEN Fix\n- In `ui/src/components/TabBar.tsx`, moved the `showAdd` block (containing `IconButton` trigger and `NewTabPopover`) outside of the `<div role=\"tablist\" className=\"flex min-w-0 items-stretch overflow-x-auto scrollbar-none\">` container, placing it immediately adjacent within `SortableContext`.\n- This resolves the CSS overflow clipping issue where the popover was clipped to tab bar height.\n\n#### 3. Restored Agents + Orca New-Tab Integration\n- **`ui/src/lib/agentsSettings.ts` & `agentsSettings.test.ts`**: Pure helpers (`loadAgentSettings`, `saveAgentSettings`, `mergeDetections`, `getLaunchableAgents`, `AGENT_CANDIDATES`, localStorage key `ferryx.agents.v1`).\n- **`ui/src/lib/tauri.ts`**: Added `detectAgents(names: string[])` invoking `cmd_agents_detect`.\n- **`ui/src/components/NewTabPopover.tsx` & `NewTabPopover.test.tsx`**: Added `agents` and `onLaunchAgent` props, rendering `AGENTS` group, plus items for New Terminal, Browser, Markdown, Mobile Emulator, and Agent settings.\n- **`ui/src/components/TabBar.tsx` & `TabBar.test.tsx`**: Passed `agents` and `onLaunchAgent` down to `NewTabPopover`.\n- **`ui/src/components/TerminalSplitView.tsx`**: Threaded `agents` and `onLaunchAgent` through layout tree to `TabBar`.\n- **`ui/src/components/SettingsDialog.tsx` & `SettingsDialog.test.tsx`**: Restored the `Agents` section with default agent selector, detected badge + refresh button, per-agent enable toggles, and expandable command/argument override inputs.\n- **`ui/src/App.tsx` & `App.test.tsx`**: Restored detection on mount under Tauri runtime, agent launch handler (`spawnTerminal` + `writeTerminal`), and passed computed launchable agents to `TerminalSplitView`.\n\n---\n\n### Verification Summary\n\n- **Targeted Test Pass Counts (`vitest`)**:\n  - `src/lib/agentsSettings.test.ts`: **7 passed**\n  - `src/components/SettingsDialog.test.tsx`: **15 passed**\n  - `src/components/NewTabPopover.test.tsx`: **9 passed**\n  - `src/components/TabBar.test.tsx`: **12 passed** (including the clipping prevention test)\n  - `src/App.test.tsx`: **18 passed**\n  - `src/lib/tauri.test.ts`: **10 passed**\n  - `src/lib/storageKeys.test.ts`: **4 passed**\n  - `src/components/SettingsDialog.workspace.test.tsx`: **1 passed**\n  - **Total: 76 passed / 76 tests (100% pass)**\n\n- **Frontend Build (`bun run --cwd ui build`)**:\n  - `tsc && vite build`: **Built successfully with 0 errors (1707 modules transformed, 1.66s).**\n\n- **Cargo / Backend**:\n  - No changes outside `ui/`.\n\n---\n\n### Files Changed\n- `ui/src/lib/agentsSettings.ts`\n- `ui/src/lib/agentsSettings.test.ts`\n- `ui/src/lib/tauri.ts`\n- `ui/src/lib/types.ts`\n- `ui/src/lib/browserTauri.ts`\n- `ui/src/components/NewTabPopover.tsx`\n- `ui/src/components/NewTabPopover.test.tsx`\n- `ui/src/components/TabBar.tsx`\n- `ui/src/components/TabBar.test.tsx`\n- `ui/src/components/TerminalSplitView.tsx`\n- `ui/src/components/tab-dnd/tabDragTypes.ts`\n- `ui/src/components/SettingsDialog.tsx`\n- `ui/src/components/SettingsDialog.test.tsx`\n- `ui/src/state/workspaceStore.ts`\n- `ui/src/App.tsx`\n- `ui/src/App.test.tsx`"}}
